[Term]
id: HP:0031146
name: Impaired oral bolus formation
def: "An abnormality of swallowing characterized by reduced tongue coordination to form bolus after chewing. Food material spreads over the oral cavity instead of being concentrated into a bolus that is easily swallowed." [PMID:16776766]
